config SENSOR_BOOT_GUARD
	bool "Gate MCUboot image processing on board input voltage"
	default y

config SENSOR_BOOT_RETRY_SECONDS
	int "Undervoltage retry interval before MCUboot image verification"
	default 60
	range 60 86400
	help
		Keep recovery responsive even when a brief input interruption does
		not discharge the PMIC's retained state. Below the recovery threshold,
		return to Hibernate without verifying the image or starting the radio.
